status: 200
content-security-policy: default-src 'none'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; font-src 'self'; form-action 'self'; base-uri 'none'; frame-ancestors 'none'; connect-src 'self'
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover"><meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow"><meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer"><title>Tap the plaque — Taptime</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/app.css"><script src="/static/js/activate.js" defer></script></head><body class="min-h-screen bg-porcelain text-ink antialiased"><main class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-md flex-col gap-6 px-4 py-8"><header class="flex items-baseline justify-between"><span class="font-display text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-tappa-green">taptime</span> <span class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-ink/70">punchless</span></header><div class="wizard"><nav aria-label="Setup progress"><p class="docket-label">Step <span class="num">4</span> of <span class="num">4</span> · Tap</p><ol class="mt-2 grid grid-cols-4 gap-1.5" role="list"><li class="wizard-segment wizard-segment--done"><span class="sr-only">Welcome</span></li><li class="wizard-segment wizard-segment--done"><span class="sr-only">Privacy</span></li><li class="wizard-segment wizard-segment--done"><span class="sr-only">Get ready</span></li><li class="wizard-segment wizard-segment--done" aria-current><span class="sr-only">Tap</span></li></ol></nav><div data-activation-wait data-status-url="/activate/status" class="flex flex-col gap-6"><div data-wait-pending class="flex flex-col gap-6"><section class="wizard-panel"><p class="docket-label">Last step</p><h1 class="mt-1 font-display text-3xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink">Now tap the plaque.</h1><p class="mt-3 text-base text-ink/85">Hold the top of your phone against any Taptime plaque at your workplace, <span class="font-bold">Kebab Factory Ltd</span></p><p class="mt-2 text-base text-ink/85">That first tap finishes setting up this phone — it doesn't clock you in.</p></section><div class="plaque-wait" aria-hidden="true"><span class="plaque-wait-ring"></span> <span class="plaque-wait-ring plaque-wait-ring--late"></span> <span class="plaque-wait-plaque"><span class="font-display text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-tappa-green">taptime</span> <span class="mt-1 font-mono text-[9px] uppercase tracking-widest text-ink/70">Hold your phone here</span></span> <span class="plaque-wait-phone"></span></div><p class="wizard-waiting" role="status"><span class="wizard-waiting-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> Waiting for your tap…</p><p class="text-center text-sm text-ink/70">When the tap goes through, your phone shows “Activation complete”.</p><p class="border-l-4 border-saffron bg-paper px-4 py-3 text-sm text-ink/85"><span class="font-bold">Tapped and saw “Finish setup in this browser”?</span> The plaque opened a different browser from this one. Open the link your workplace sent you in that browser and go through the steps there.</p><div class="wizard-actions"><a href="/activate?step=3" class="wizard-back">Back</a></div></div><div data-wait-done hidden tabindex="-1" class="flex flex-col gap-6"><section class="docket wizard-panel"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3"><p class="docket-label">Setup</p><span class="stamp stamp--approved">Activated</span></div><h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink">Activation complete</h1><p class="mt-1 font-display text-base text-ink/85">This phone is set up for Maria Borg</p></section><section class="border-l-4 border-tappa-green bg-green-lite px-4 py-4"><p class="font-display font-bold tracking-tight">This phone is now your time clock.</p><div class="mt-1 text-sm text-ink/85">To check in, tap the plaque again — that next tap counts.</div></section><p class="pt-2 text-center font-display text-lg tracking-tight text-ink/70">You can close this page.</p></div></div></div></main></body></html>